From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] httpapi, http.sys: HttpWaitForDisconnect(Ex) and HttpCancelHttpRequest

Spec stubs before; .NET's HttpListener calls them (HttpWaitForDisconnect for connection-based authentication, HttpCancelHttpRequest when a request is aborted). Two http.sys ioctls: IOCTL_HTTP_WAIT_DISCONNECT pends on the connection (the HTTP_REQUEST's ConnectionId) until it closes, by the client or the server, and is cancellable; IOCTL_HTTP_CANCEL_REQUEST closes the connection of a request of this queue, so the client sees it end, its waits complete and no response can follow (ERROR_CONNECTION_INVALID). An id that names no open connection or request is ERROR_CONNECTION_INVALID, HTTP_NULL_ID and a non-zero Reserved ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER; without an OVERLAPPED the call waits. http.h gains the prototypes. Conformance test test_v1_disconnect.
---
--- a/include/http.h
+++ b/include/http.h
@@ -488,6 +488,9 @@
 HTTPAPI_LINKAGE ULONG WINAPI HttpQueryServiceConfiguration(HANDLE,HTTP_SERVICE_CONFIG_ID,PVOID,ULONG,PVOID,ULONG,PULONG,LPOVERLAPPED);
 HTTPAPI_LINKAGE ULONG WINAPI HttpReceiveHttpRequest(HANDLE queue, HTTP_REQUEST_ID id, ULONG flags, HTTP_REQUEST *request, ULONG size, ULONG *ret_size, OVERLAPPED *ovl);
 HTTPAPI_LINKAGE ULONG WINAPI HttpReceiveRequestEntityBody(HANDLE queue, HTTP_REQUEST_ID id, ULONG flags, void *buffer, ULONG size, ULONG *ret_size, OVERLAPPED *ovl);
+HTTPAPI_LINKAGE ULONG WINAPI HttpCancelHttpRequest(HANDLE queue, HTTP_REQUEST_ID id, OVERLAPPED *ovl);
+HTTPAPI_LINKAGE ULONG WINAPI HttpWaitForDisconnect(HANDLE queue, HTTP_CONNECTION_ID id, OVERLAPPED *ovl);
+HTTPAPI_LINKAGE ULONG WINAPI HttpWaitForDisconnectEx(HANDLE queue, HTTP_CONNECTION_ID id, ULONG reserved, OVERLAPPED *ovl);
 HTTPAPI_LINKAGE ULONG WINAPI HttpRemoveUrl(HANDLE queue, const WCHAR *url);
 HTTPAPI_LINKAGE ULONG WINAPI HttpRemoveUrlFromUrlGroup(HTTP_URL_GROUP_ID id, const WCHAR *url, ULONG flags);
 HTTPAPI_LINKAGE ULONG WINAPI HttpSendHttpResponse(HANDLE queue, HTTP_REQUEST_ID id, ULONG flags, HTTP_RESPONSE *response, HTTP_CACHE_POLICY *cache_policy, ULONG *ret_size, void *reserved1, ULONG reserved2, OVERLAPPED *ovl, HTTP_LOG_DATA *log_data);
